@base = http://localhost:5001
@key = dev-api-key

### Liveness
GET {{base}}/health/live

### Readiness (checks the database)
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Create a link with a generated code
POST {{base}}/api/links
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://example.com/some/long/path" }

### Create a link with a custom code
POST {{base}}/api/links
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "https://github.com", "customCode": "ghub" }

### Look up a code (no key, used by the redirect service)
GET {{base}}/api/links/ghub

### List links with an optional search filter
GET {{base}}/api/links?search=git&take=20
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
